{"id":"vod_lz_74442","vodId":"74442","provider":"lz","providerName":"量子资源","type":2,"name":"冥王","name_cn":"冥王","date":"2023-01-01","year":"2023","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.lzipic.com/upload/vod/20231027-1/d423e7bc4a3c24942dcdf21b7516fd0d.jpg"},"summary":"　　被众人誉为杰作的漫画《PLUTO 冥王》改编自手冢治虫于 1964 年推出的《Astro Boy ‘The Greatest Robot on Earth’》，由浦泽直树（《20 世纪少年》《以柔克刚》《危险调查员》）与其长期创作伙伴长嶝高士联合创作。　　这个悬疑故事的背景设定在一个新未来主义世界，人类和高性能机器人和谐共处，生活十分融洽。这部享誉全球的漫画斩获了无数奖项，包括手冢治虫文化奖。2015 年改编的《PLUTO 冥王》舞台剧应大众需求于 2018 年回归，并在日本和欧洲巡回演出。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"剧情,科幻,动画,悬疑,惊悚"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-10-27 09:46:19","episodeCount":8,"playable":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"lzm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v.cdnlz9.com/20231027/19695_aad860f6/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v.cdnlz9.com/20231027/19696_e2276274/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v.cdnlz9.com/20231027/19697_83bebbc9/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v.cdnlz9.com/20231027/19698_21e493d5/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v.cdnlz9.com/20231027/19699_08671c78/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v.cdnlz9.com/20231027/19701_9b54061b/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v.cdnlz9.com/20231027/19700_ec77ea8f/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v.cdnlz9.com/20231027/19702_ae9bc280/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-21T08:56:35.768Z"}